%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial Table_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 97b4510909976a64082e7c15b4b1356d, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 10054545956864
    m_Localized: Nice to see you, User. I am <font="galBold">NA1L</font>, your OS
      and Video Editing Assistant provided by Manasoft.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151168
    m_Localized: "Finding the video editing outsourcing process difficult? \nDon\u2019t
      you worry! I\u2019ll guide you step-by-step. And DON\"T even dream of skipping!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151169
    m_Localized: "To start, we encourage you to visit <font=\"galBold\">MSN</font>
      everyday to contribute to the traffic growth of Manasoft\u2019s flagship network.\n\n*This
      notification contains advertisements for Manasoft."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151170
    m_Localized: "<font=\"galBold\">Mana Scroll Network</font> provides <font=\"galBold\">daily
      news updates</font>. \nIt\u2019s perfect for catching up on what happened overnight!\n\n*This
      notification contains advertisements for Manasoft."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151171
    m_Localized: "Now, let\u2019s click the [X] button to close this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151172
    m_Localized: According to your contract, your outsourcing work will be conducted
      using OwlLook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151173
    m_Localized: Oh, look! A letter has just arrived! Click on <font="galBold">OwlLook</font>
      to launch the program.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151174
    m_Localized: You can check the details by clicking on the subject line in your
      inbox.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151175
    m_Localized: "Manasoft is currently offering free daily special effects for Worlds
      Movie Weaver to celebrate the birth of a new Hero. \nCheck your email for details!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151176
    m_Localized: Per the contract, one editing request will arrive each day. Don't
      forget to check in daily.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151177
    m_Localized: "All the files you need for the assignment are in the attachments.
      \nIf you're ready, click the attachment and let's start crafting the commissioned
      video."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151178
    m_Localized: 'Manasoft <font="galBold">Worlds Movie Weaver</font> is a customized
      workspace designed for creating videos. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151179
    m_Localized: Here, users can freely bring any vision they imagine to life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151180
    m_Localized: Let's get started with the walkthrough for <font="galBold">Worlds
      Movie Weaver.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151181
    m_Localized: The program is all set, so you can start editing now. Click <font="galBold">'Start
      Editing'</font> when you're ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151182
    m_Localized: "Don't panic\u2014<font=\"galBold\">NA1L</font> is here with you!
      Let's take it one step at a time."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151183
    m_Localized: "This screen at the top is the <font=\"galBold\">Timeline Viewer</font>.
      This is where you can preview the video you\u2019re creating."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151184
    m_Localized: "This is the <font=\"galBold\">Timeline</font>. It\u2019s the panel
      where you construct your video. Everything about your video is decided right
      here."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151185
    m_Localized: From the center, the top half is for <font="galBold">Enemy Clips</font>,
      and the bottom half is for <font="galBold">Hero Clips</font>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151186
    m_Localized: This is the <font="galBold">Library</font>, where all your clips
      and effects are stored.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151187
    m_Localized: "And finally\u2026 these are the <font=\"galBold\">Video Clips</font>!
      They are the main ingredients of your video production."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151188
    m_Localized: You can arrange them on the timeline to create the scene you want.
      Shall we try?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151189
    m_Localized: "What\u2019s displayed here is the <font=\"galBold\">Enemy Attack</font>.
      \nIf you hover your mouse over an enemy attack clip, you can see the target
      area in the Viewer."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151190
    m_Localized: "You're bound to get hit at this rate\u2014hardly a heroic look.
      Why don't we give our Hero a more stylish escape?\nLet's create a scene where
      the Hero dodges the attack."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151191
    m_Localized: "You can find specific clips by checking the <font=\"galBold\">filters</font>
      at the top of the Library. \n<font=\"galBold\">Check 'Move'</font> to find
      the right clip."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151192
    m_Localized: <font="galBold">Drag and drop the Move block to the designated spot.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151193
    m_Localized: Once placed, click <font="galBold">'Reset Selection'</font> to clear
      the filter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151194
    m_Localized: "Well done! \nYou can click a Move block to change its direction.
      \nLet\u2019s make the Hero move upward. \n<font=\"galBold\">Click to change
      the direction!</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151195
    m_Localized: Great! Now, <font="galBold">grab the cursor and drag it to the indicator</font>
      to see how the Hero acts in the Viewer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151196
    m_Localized: "The Hero successfully dodged! You can direct the Hero\u2019s actions
      using clips like this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151197
    m_Localized: But you can't just run away forever if you want a glorious victory.
      A true Hero needs to strike back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151198
    m_Localized: 'Looking at the attachments, there are two types of weapons the
      Hero can use:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151199
    m_Localized: "There's the <font=\"galBold\">Ranged Attack</font>, \nallowing
      you to hit the enemy consistently <font=\"galBold\">regardless of where you
      are...</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151200
    m_Localized: 'and the <font="galBold">Melee Attack</font>, which is restricted
      to <font="galBold">the row right in front of the enemy. </font>

      It may
      be limited in range, but it deals significantly higher damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151201
    m_Localized: "Let\u2019s place a Ranged Attack clip first. <font=\"galBold\">Click
      the checkbox to find one.</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151202
    m_Localized: Ranged attacks work no matter where the Hero is. <font="galBold">Place
      it in the designated spot.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151203
    m_Localized: "Uh-oh. According to my calculations, that wasn't exactly the best
      possible move. \nNo need to panic, though! Clip placements can be modified
      freely before the sequence begins."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151204
    m_Localized: "You <font=\"galBold\">can adjust clip positions using drag-and-drop</font>,
      \nand a <font=\"galBold\">simple right-click will cancel any placement.</font>
      \nGive it a try\u2014use these features to <font=\"galBold\">fix the layout
      of your Ranged clips!</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151205
    m_Localized: "Next up: Melee Attacks. \nSince Melee only works from the very
      front, you\u2019ll need to step forward one space. \nLet\u2019s reset your
      filters and <font=\"galBold\">check the 'Melee Attack' box</font> to find the
      right clip."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151206
    m_Localized: "Oh, here\u2019s a clip that combines both Move and Attack! \n<font=\"galBold\">Place
      it in the spot</font> and change the direction so the Hero moves into attacking
      range."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151207
    m_Localized: "Nicely done. \nHowever, if we stay like this, you\u2019re going
      to take a hit on the next turn. \nAnd honestly... that's just not a very good
      look for a Hero, is it? This is exactly when you need <font=\"galBold\">'Guard'</font>."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151208
    m_Localized: Let's reset filters and <font="galBold">check the Guard box</font>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151209
    m_Localized: This clip assumes a defensive stance <font="galBold">to nullify
      damage from the very next attack.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151210
    m_Localized: "<font=\"galBold\">Let\u2019s place that Guard clip you found into
      the designated spot.</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151211
    m_Localized: Now, <font="galBold">click the 'Move' icon</font> attached to the
      Guard and have our Hero step down one space.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151212
    m_Localized: Perfect. Now that all clips are placed, <font="galBold">press the
      Play button to execute the scene.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151213
    m_Localized: "What a magnificent video! \nAs you can see, the Hero moves exactly
      as you arranged the clips."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151214
    m_Localized: By repeating this process, you can easily create a video of the
      Hero's victory right here in <font="galBold">Worlds Movie Weaver.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151215
    m_Localized: "But beware\u2014video length is limited! <font=\"galBold\">If you
      exceed it, the program may crash.</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151216
    m_Localized: "Now, let\u2019s move on to the next scene. \nWe\u2019re going to
      produce an even more impactful scene this time.\nGo ahead and reset your filters,
      then <font=\"galBold\">click the 'Ranged Attack' checkbox.</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151217
    m_Localized: <font="galBold">Drag the 'Move + Ranged Attack' combo clip to the
      spot.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151218
    m_Localized: "This is a <font=\"galBold\">Charged Attack</font>; the longer you
      charge, <font=\"galBold\">the more powerful it gets.</font> \n<font=\"galBold\">But
      be careful\u2014taking damage will cancel the charge!</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151219
    m_Localized: An enemy attack is predicted to land exactly when your Ranged attack
      ends.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151220
    m_Localized: "It seems you\u2019ll need to move somewhere safe... \nSince we're
      at it, why don't we try a Special Effect? <font=\"galBold\">Click the Special
      Effects tab.</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151221
    m_Localized: "<font=\"galBold\">Special Effects</font> are <font=\"galBold\">unique
      abilities</font> that make your clips more diverse. \nThey are usually paid
      features, but we're having an event where you can try some for free!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151222
    m_Localized: At the moment, only the 'Haste' effect is available. Let's use it.
      <font="galBold">Drag and drop the Haste effect onto the Move clip.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151223
    m_Localized: <font="galBold">Click the Move clip</font> and set the arrow to
      the left so the Hero goes to the very back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151224
    m_Localized: Haste doubles your movement distance. Now we can safely dodge and
      unleash that Charged Ranged attack!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151225
    m_Localized: 'But do you see the Memory filling up? <font="galBold">Each effect
      consumes memory. </font>

      And once you run out, you won''t be able to
      use any more effects!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151226
    m_Localized: But don't look so sad. Movie Weaver provides its own optimization
      feature for users just like you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151227
    m_Localized: <font="galBold">As long as you follow these conditions</font>, you
      can squeeze out even more effects from your limited memory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151228
    m_Localized: "Now that you\u2019ve mastered all the features of Worlds Movie
      Weaver, let\u2019s wrap up this video and finish off that enemy!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151229
    m_Localized: "First, let\u2019s unleash a powerful attack to finish off the enemy
      once and for all. \nReset your filter selection and <font=\"galBold\">select
      the 'Melee Attack' filter.</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151230
    m_Localized: Good job. Now <font="galBold">place the Melee Charge attack in the
      designated spot.</font>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151231
    m_Localized: "It has the traits of both Melee and Charging: \n<font=\"galBold\">it
      only works up close</font> and <font=\"galBold\">it\u2019ll break if you take
      a hit mid-charge.</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151232
    m_Localized: "To pull off a move like this, you\u2019ll need to get within striking
      distance. \n<font=\"galBold\">Let\u2019s place a 'Move' clip with the 'Haste'
      effect applied to it,</font> so our Hero can dash straight to the front line."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151233
    m_Localized: Excellent. Now our Hero is all set to execute that Melee Charge
      without a hitch!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151234
    m_Localized: "With these clips in place, you\u2019re set to deal a total of 11
      damage. \nSince the enemy only has 7 HP left, this victory is practically in
      the bag!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151235
    m_Localized: "Now, <font=\"galBold\">hit the play button and let\u2019s run the
      scene.</font>"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151236
    m_Localized: What a stunning video! It really looks like our Hero is clearing
      a real dungeon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151237
    m_Localized: You did a wonderful job. Completed videos are saved automatically
      and can be exported immediately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 10054550151238
    m_Localized: "That\u2019s all from me! Was I helpful?\n\nNow, please <font=\"galBold\">click
      the 'Save and Export' button to output your file. </font>\nThis assistant will
      now shut down automatically."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
